{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650230/extras/FP_Steam_Gif.gif?t=1745426813\" />\ud83c\udfa9 <strong>FORTUNE PARADOX: LUCK OR WISDOM?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fortune Paradox</strong> is a psychological luck game where your decisions shape your destiny, as you swing between risk and reward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each round, you're faced with a question.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your answer can either increase your fortune\u2026 or push you into bankruptcy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>But remember:</strong> If your money drops to <strong>0 or below</strong>, the game is over.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udd01 <strong>THE LOOP IS SIMPLE:</strong><br></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udde0 <strong>1 question</strong><br>\ud83c\udfaf <strong>2-6 options</strong><br>\u267e\ufe0f <strong>Endless possibilities</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each choice can make you richer\u2026 or bring your downfall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you trust your luck, or your instinct?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udfb0 <strong>WHAT AWAITS YOU IN FORTUNE PARADOX?</strong><br><br> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udccf <strong>Decision-Based Gameplay:</strong><br>Every answer leads to a fate. Every fate brings irreversible consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfb2 <strong>High Risk \u2013 High Reward:</strong><br>Get rich with the right guess, lose everything with a single mistake.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Psychological Tension:</strong><br>Even a simple coin toss can make you sweat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u267b\ufe0f <strong>Highly Replayable:</strong><br>Questions and outcomes change every time you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Philosophical and Personal Choices:</strong><br>This isn\u2019t just a game. It\u2019s an experience where you confront yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83c\udfc6 LEADERBOARD: CAN YOU BE THE BEST?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fortune Paradox is not just a game of chance \u2014 it\u2019s a test of dominance.<br>Each decision might push you <strong>higher on the leaderboard\u2026 or drop you straight down.</strong><br><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcca <strong>Ranked by Rounds:</strong> Who can survive the longest?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcb0 <strong>Ranked by Wealth:</strong> Who can accumulate the most money?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Outsmart your friends, claim the top, and share it on social media:<br><strong>&quot;Look, I mastered fate.&quot;</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udfaf <strong>WHO IS IT FOR?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fortune Paradox is ideal for players who:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udde0 Love strategy and thoughtful decisions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcb8 Enjoy taking risks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfad Are into psychological games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfb2 Want to feel like fate is in their hands</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udcac <strong>FINAL WORD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>\u201cSometimes, one choice is enough to lose everything.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong>Fortune Paradox, </strong>every decision comes with a price.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>So... what will you choose?</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3650230?t=1745426813","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3650230?t=1745426813","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650230/64fc740345d7ad4e439ef2a6046360979fffd0be/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745426813","capsule_imagev5":"https: